       "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Consultation Form Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a consultation form?\", \"a\": \"A consultation form is a short questionnaire a client fills in before a first meeting with a professional, such as a stylist or a designer. It records what the client wants and what they can spend. With those details read in advance, the meeting can start on the real question.\"}, {\"q\": \"How to make a client consultation form?\", \"a\": \"Start with what the answers should change, such as who takes the meeting or how long it runs. Then describe your service and your questions to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a>. It builds the form with its routing, along with a table that keeps every response.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a consultation form for estheticians?\", \"a\": \"Estheticians use one to learn about a client's skin before a facial, including the current routine and any recent treatments. The answers shape which products the esthetician reaches for. For a version built around skin studios, see the esthetician intake form.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is an example of a consultation form?\", \"a\": \"A wedding photographer's form is a typical one. It asks for the date, the venue, the guest count, and which parts of the day the couple wants covered. The photographer reads it before the call and quotes from real details instead of guesses.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find a consultation form template?\", \"a\": \"Form builder galleries carry consultation forms for most service types. Emergent starts from your description instead and writes questions for your business. Name the service and the decisions the answers drive. Compared with a consultation form template, you skip deleting the questions that do not fit.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is there a free consultation form I can use?\", \"a\": \"Emergent is free to start, and the free tier covers building and publishing a form. Describe your service and you get a free consultation form at a link clients can open on any phone. Every answer is saved to a database you own.\"}, {\"q\": \"Should a consultation form be paper or online?\", \"a\": \"Online suits most businesses. A consultation form PDF is easy to print or email, but each completed copy has to be read and filed by hand. A web form saves every answer to a table you can sort and search, and clients fill it in on their phones.\"}, {\"q\": \"What questions should consultation forms include?\", \"a\": \"Start with contact details and the service the client wants. Then ask for their goal and their budget, plus anything that changes how the meeting runs. Cut any question whose answer you would not act on.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a discovery call form?\", \"a\": \"A discovery call form is what consultants and agencies send before a first sales call. It asks what the company does and what prompted the call. The person taking the call reads it beforehand and spends the time on whether the work is a fit.\"}, {\"q\": \"What questions go on a massage consultation form?\", \"a\": \"It asks which areas need work and how much pressure the client likes. It also asks about anything the therapist should avoid, such as a recent injury, with the health questions set by your practice. For a fuller version, see the <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/massage-intake-form'>massage intake form</a>.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
      }
     },
     {
      "id": "6accba1c29454f1af2f01f13",
      "fieldData": {
       "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Order Form Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is an order form in business?\", \"a\": \"An order form is the record of what a buyer wants: the items, quantities and prices, who is buying, and how the order is paid for and delivered. Businesses use order forms to take orders without phone calls or long email threads.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create an order form?\", \"a\": \"List what you sell with a price for each item, then decide what the buyer fills in. Describe both to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a>, and it builds the form, adds up each order, and saves it as a row.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are the different types of order forms?\", \"a\": \"A purchase order comes from the buyer. A sales order comes from the seller to confirm what it will ship. Work orders assign a job, while pre-order forms take orders before stock arrives. For buyer-side approvals, use a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/purchase-order-form'>purchase order form</a>.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is another name for order form?\", \"a\": \"Sales order form and business order form both name the same document. The label often follows the job: an agency scoping work calls it a service order form, and a purchasing team requesting stock calls it a procurement order form.\"}, {\"q\": \"Are order form templates enough to take orders online?\", \"a\": \"Not on their own. Order form templates settle the layout, but a template cannot hide a sold-out item or stop taking orders at a cutoff. A form built with Emergent handles both, with no response caps during a holiday rush.\"}, {\"q\": \"How does an online order form take payment?\", \"a\": \"Online order forms hand the card to the payment processor the seller connects on the last step, and the charge equals the total on screen. Repeat trade buyers with their own price list usually need a wholesale order form instead.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find a free order form template?\", \"a\": \"Form builders and design sites publish free order form templates in Word and PDF. Pick one whose columns match what you sell, then change the item rows and prices. Check that it has a quantity column and a line total for each row.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a simple order form include?\", \"a\": \"Keep it to the buyer's name and contact details, one row per item with its quantity and price, and a running total. Then add the delivery or pickup choice and the way the buyer pays. A notes field catches requests such as gift wrap.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I make a free online order form?\", \"a\": \"Yes. A free online order form needs only your product list and a link to share. Emergent is free to start, and the free tier covers building and publishing a form with a live URL. Card payments still carry the processor's fee on each successful charge.\"}, {\"q\": \"What does an order form example look like?\", \"a\": \"Among order form examples, a coffee roaster's is typical. It lists three beans at $16 a bag, asks whole bean or ground, and adds $5 shipping under $40. For one-off designs with artwork uploads, a custom order form fits better.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
      }
     },
     {
      "id": "6acf52f60f7b944568915ad8",
      "fieldData": {
       "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"PMU Consent Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a permanent makeup consent form?\", \"a\": \"A permanent makeup consent form is the document a client reads and signs before a cosmetic tattoo procedure such as microblading or lip blush. It explains the procedure and its risks, records the client's answers to the artist's questions, and holds the signature.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I make a permanent makeup consent form for my studio?\", \"a\": \"Start from the wording your artist uses at consultation. Describe it and your procedures to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a>, which builds the form, a table of signed records, and the photo uploads. Clients get a PDF of the signed permanent makeup consent form by email. Change any part later by asking in plain English.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is there a free permanent makeup consent form template?\", \"a\": \"Several form builders and studios post free ones. Any permanent makeup consent form template still carries another studio's wording. Read it next to your artist's consultation notes and keep only what your artist says out loud. Emergent can build the form from those notes instead, and it is free to start.\"}, {\"q\": \"What forms does a studio need besides the permanent makeup consent form?\", \"a\": \"A medical history intake usually comes first, and an aftercare sheet the client signs before leaving comes after the session. Studios that post healed results also need a photo release. On Emergent each of these saves to a database the studio owns, with no cap on responses.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a microblading consent form include?\", \"a\": \"The client's details and date of birth, answers about earlier brow work, the initialed risk statements, and the signature. Microblading is a hand-tool tattoo that places pigment in hair-like strokes. Add the pigment and its lot number after the session, and the form becomes the session record too.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does lip blushing need its own permanent makeup consent form?\", \"a\": \"It needs its own risk statements more than its own document. Your artist explains lip blush differently from brows, and a client booking lips should initial only the lip statements. A form that branches by procedure keeps one record per client.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is an ombre powder brows consent form different from microblading?\", \"a\": \"The structure is the same, from the screening questions to the signature. The technique field changes, along with any risk your artist explains differently for shading. One brow form with a technique choice keeps both services on the same client record.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is a semi permanent makeup consent form any different?\", \"a\": \"No, it is the same document under another name. Brow studios often call microblading semi-permanent because the pigment fades, yet the FDA still describes permanent makeup as a type of tattoo. Studios that also do larger body work can keep a separate <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/tattoo-consent-form'>tattoo consent form</a> for it.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I offer a microblading consent form in Spanish?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Ask Emergent for a Spanish version and the client picks a language on the first screen. Have a fluent speaker check the risk statements first, since a translated warning has to say exactly what the English one says. Both versions save to the same table.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does brow lamination need a permanent makeup consent form?\", \"a\": \"No. Lamination is not a tattoo, and the tattoo risk statements on a PMU form do not apply to it. Studios that offer lamination and tinting can collect those details with an esthetician intake form instead.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
      }
     }
